==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 30000 series|30000 series]] (6-car sets):
*: The exclusive rolling stock for the Asahi Line. Introduced in 2011 to replace the aging 60 series, these trains feature a distinctive golden-yellow band and LED interior lighting that adjusts color temperature based on the time of day. They are equipped with advanced noise-dampening wheels to navigate the sharp curves in the Nakanoshima and Kitahama sections.

